*
!.gitignore
!*.ttl
!a-001/
!a-001/**

# The negations above re-include everything under a-001/, which overrides the
# root .gitignore's __pycache__/ and *.py[cod] rules — a deeper .gitignore
# wins over a shallower one. Re-exclude the bytecode here, after the negation,
# so the last matching pattern is this one.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
